# ─── OCR model weights ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Tracked in git deliberately: production has no removable-media/USB deploy
# path, only `git pull` — so these binaries (~25MB total: det+cls+rec_en+
# rec_ru) are the only way a fine-tuned model reaches the shop-floor PCs.

# ─── OCR fine-tuning tooling (dev-only; never deployed) ─────────────────────
# Cloned PaddleOCR training repo, downloaded pretrained checkpoints, the
# training-only GPU venv, and generated crop+label training datasets are all
# multi-GB, machine-specific, and reproducible from scratch — never commit
# them. See backend/finetune/README.md for how to regenerate.
backend/finetune/PaddleOCR/
backend/finetune/pretrained/
backend/finetune/.venv-train/
backend/finetune/train_data/
backend/finetune/output/
backend/finetune/state/
backend/finetune/rejected/

# Original field-collected melt-number dataset (~600 real images) used to
# bootstrap/supplement fine-tuning — real photos, not source, never tracked
# (the repo-root images/+labels.json predecessor never was either).
/dataset/

# ─── OAK1 camera SDK runtime cache (device firmware/blob cache) ────────────
scripts/.cache/
